# Recipe A / TGFX environment template
# ------------------------------------
# Copy to .env if needed. The dataset pipeline (Phases 1-3) needs NO secrets
# and NO environment variables; this file documents variables that later build
# phases may read. .env is gitignored — never commit real values.

# --- Model caches (Phases 4-11; keep large weights off the system drive) ---
# HF_HOME=D:/hf-cache
# TORCH_HOME=D:/torch-cache

# --- GPU policy (decision D11: local GPU always) ---
# CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0
# Deterministic cuBLAS matmuls (set automatically by src/encoder/torch_ae.py;
# export it yourself if you import torch before the encoder module):
# CUBLAS_WORKSPACE_CONFIG=:4096:8

# --- Optional test toggles ---
# RUN_BROWSER_SMOKE=1   # opt-in Streamlit browser smoke test
